msgstr ""
"MyISAM "
"သိုလှောင်မှုအင်ဂျင်ကို "
"မပံ့ပိုးထားပါ။"

msgid "0 seconds"
msgstr "0 စက္ကန့်"

msgid ""
"The validation failed because the value conflicts with the value in "
"%field_name, which you cannot access."
msgstr ""
"검증이 실패했습니다. 값이 %field_name에 있는 값과 "
